{
  "_about": [
    "One entry per character build. After editing, run:  py -I tools/make_builds.py   (or the dashboard button 'Rebuild skill plans').",
    "base_profile: your own finished phBot profile of that build (in <phBot>/Config). Masteries, stats, the Auto Mastery list and",
    "  every other setting come from it.",
    "skills: the FINAL lists (phBot names), in casting order. null = take them from base_profile. Skills that unlock above",
    "  final_level are replaced by the best rank of the same line that unlocks by then.",
    "Every 10 levels gets its own profile (Lv001-010 ... Lv091-100): each final skill is replaced by the best rank of its",
    "  line unlocked by the end of that bracket. The plugin uses lower ranks until the planned one is learned.",
    "party_buffs: phBot Party Buffs category -> 'party' (every other member), 'ring' (the next member of the same build;",
    "  for buffs that can't be cast on self and that every member of the build casts), 'pair' (members of the same build",
    "  in twos that buff each other: 1<->2, 3<->4 ...; an odd last one pairs with the first), or a list of build ids.",
    "create: what a missing character is created with (model + chest, legs, shoes, weapon)."
